{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "熊喵不在了以后，我注意到很多事。", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个不可思议的生物，对我们来说究竟是多么重要的存在。", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后的校舍。", "text_idx": 143, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在学生们的谈笑声中，仿佛能听到那声有活力的“噜～”。", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……新吾君，辛苦了～”", "text_idx": 118, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 149, "voice": "mu2232", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“辛苦了。”", "text_idx": 125, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 144, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐还是一样，自由出席之后也是会到社团来。", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天，看见了美羽学姐的眼泪，第一次听见她的哭声。", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我说不出安慰她的话。", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──请打起精神来。", "text_idx": 126, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一句话，或许会给美羽学姐造成压力也说不定。", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家也都体贴学姐，不提起熊喵的事情。", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“昨天抱歉喔，让你看到那么丢脸的样子。”", "text_idx": 122, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 149, "voice": "mu2233", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有……”", "text_idx": 123, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 144, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小熊喵现在应该在跟妈妈撒娇吧～”", "text_idx": 120, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 149, "voice": "mu2234", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 113, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 144, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一定很幸福吧。因为能跟最喜欢的妈妈在一起。”", "text_idx": 115, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 149, "voice": "mu2235", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我也这么觉得。”", "text_idx": 114, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 144, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 113, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 149, "voice": "mu2236", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我明明那么喜欢学姐的笑容，此时看到却觉得难受。", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从早上我就一直在思考。", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在的自己能做到的事情。", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了最喜欢的人能做的事。", "text_idx": 128, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐呐新吾君，放学后要不要到我家来？”", "text_idx": 117, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 149, "voice": "mu2237", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以吗？”", "text_idx": 116, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 144, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，如果新吾君不麻烦的话……”", "text_idx": 119, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 149, "voice": "mu2238", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么会麻烦。”", "text_idx": 121, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 144, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我笑着握住学姐的手。", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想待在离她最近的地方，对她微笑。", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你♪”", "text_idx": 124, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 149, "voice": "mu2239", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐很快就要从这所学校毕业了。", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这有限的时间里。", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我要待在她身边。", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仅仅是待在她身边。", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要学姐露出笑容，我也会笑。", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当学姐笑不出来的时候，我就抱住她。", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_29.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没有前进也没有后退，就这样原地踏步的日子持续了好一阵子。", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
